* MC VARIANT (fitc10 campaign, 2026-10-22): identical equations to trace2_otft_v2.sub, plus two per-instance
* multipliers for local mismatch: KMU (mobility, scales beta) and KRC (contact resistance, scales rc2).
* Defaults KMU=1 KRC=1 reproduce trace2_otft_v2.sub. Original file is unchanged.
* ==================================================================
* trace2_otft_v2.sub - p-type organic TFT compact model for Tortoise, v2
* ==================================================================
* DC: identical to v1 (trace2_otft.sub / verification/otft_model.py):
*   sp(x)   = S * ln(1 + exp(x/S)),   S = 2 * SS / ln(10)
*   I(s->d) = (beta/2) * [ sp(V_si - V_g - Vth)^2 - sp(V_di - V_g - Vth)^2 ]
*             + W * JOFF * tanh(V_si,di / 0.1 V)
* Capacitance (CHANGED from v1, which used a fixed Ci*W*(L/2+LOV) per side):
*   overlap   : Ci*W*LOV per side, linear (bias independent)
*   channel   : gate charge Q = -Ci*W*(L/2)*[ sp(V_si-V_g-Vth) + sp(V_di-V_g-Vth) ]
*               split as one term per channel end, implemented via a 1 pF auxiliary capacitor (see below).
*   => off: channel C -> 0; linear: Ci*W*L split 50/50; saturation: drain-side
*      channel C -> 0, source side Ci*W*L/2.
* Known simplification: in saturation the source side should carry ~2/3 Ci*W*L
* (Meyer); this model gives 1/2. Charge-conserving (charges are node functions).
* Units: MU cm^2/Vs, CI F/cm^2, SS V/dec, RCW ohm*cm, JOFF A/um, VTH0 V, LOV um
* ==================================================================
.subckt potft d g s W=10 L=5 DVTH=0 KMU=1 KRC=1
.param vth   = {VTH0 + DVTH}
.param sw    = {2*SS/ln(10)}
.param beta  = {KMU*MU*CI*W/L}
.param rc2   = {max(KRC*RCW/(W*1e-4)/2, 1e-3)}
.param cov   = {CI*1e-8*W*LOV}
.param qch   = {CI*1e-8*W*L/2}
Rcs s si {rc2}
Rcd d di {rc2}
B1 si di I = {beta/2} * ( ({sw}*ln(1+exp((v(si,g)-{vth})/{sw})))^2
+                       - ({sw}*ln(1+exp((v(di,g)-{vth})/{sw})))^2 )
+            + {W*JOFF}*tanh(v(si,di)/0.1)
Cgso g si {cov}
Cgdo g di {cov}
* channel charge, implemented without ddt(): V(xq) = Q [pC] drives a 1 pF cap,
* the sensed current dQ/dt is injected gate->channel-end by a CCCS.
Bqs xqs 0 V = -{qch*1e12} * {sw}*ln(1+exp((v(si,g)-{vth})/{sw}))
Vqs xqs xqsc 0
Cqs xqsc 0 1e-12
Fqs g si Vqs 1
Bqd xqd 0 V = -{qch*1e12} * {sw}*ln(1+exp((v(di,g)-{vth})/{sw}))
Vqd xqd xqdc 0
Cqd xqdc 0 1e-12
Fqd g di Vqd 1
Rleak si di 1e14
.ends potft
